{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22011","headline":"寓意诗五首 二 · 白居易","name":"寓意诗五首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赫赫京内史，炎炎中书郎。\n昨传徵拜日，恩赐颇殊常。\n貂冠水苍玉，紫绶黄金章。\n佩服身未暖，已闻窜遐荒。\n亲戚不得别，吞声泣路旁。\n宾客亦已散，门前雀罗张。\n富贵来不久，倏如瓦沟霜。\n权势去尤速，瞥若石火光。\n不如守贫贱，贫贱可久长。\n传语宦游子，且来归故乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22011.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22011","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}